// Title: Disk and file-system errors
// Source: Log Analytics
// Tables: Event
// When to use: Pairs with Hardware Status alerts. Early warning before a disk fails outright.
// Tune: Event IDs 7, 51, 153 (disk), 55 (Ntfs corruption).

Event
| where TimeGenerated > ago(7d)
| where EventLog == "System" and Source in ("disk", "Ntfs", "storvsc") and EventID in (7, 51, 55, 153)
| summarize Errors = count(), First = min(TimeGenerated), Last = max(TimeGenerated) by Computer, Source, EventID
| order by Errors desc
